bluejetty:00087873:ios.description:
Meet Case Clicker - it's a game where you can open a bunch of cases, earn gold in the clicker and enjoy a lot of collections. The number of original mechanics will not let you get bored, and quick updates will immediately give you the opportunity to open new collections.
In this standoff case simulator you can:
- open cases, boxes, sticker packs and charm packs;
- sell and buy items on the market;
- and examine items in 3D with cool graphics!
Case Simulator has all the mechanics implemented, so download and try it out!
What makes this simulator stand out? Full list:
- Cool 3D inspection with beautiful graphics;
- A huge number of collections;
- A bunch of different activities;
- Working patterns;
- Stickers that you can put on your weapons
- Charms (or keychains) that have physics and can be put on weapons too
- A marketplace with filters where you can find any item;
- Crafting, stattracks, pumping, clicker and a bunch of other mechanics that will not let you get bored.
- Lots of emotions
Note: This game is a simulation created for entertainment purposes by a fan for fans. The game is in no way related to other games, does not claim any rights. All marks and trademarks are the property of their respective owners.

